//! Microsoft WHCP Windows Server 2025 Device.Storage requirements, as spit runs it: each of the suite's tests by its own ID, the spit cases that
//! decide it, and what spit does not yet run. Built from the suites inventory; a test spit
//! starts running gets its cases and coverage here.

